# Fair Fasteners — project context

## Stack
- Next.js App Router (`src/app`), React 19, Tailwind v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"` in `globals.css`), TypeScript.
- **Fonts:** Primary typeface is **Manrope** via `next/font/google` (`--font-manrope` → `font-sans` on `<body>`). **Geist** + **Geist Mono** remain loaded (`--font-geist-sans`, `--font-geist-mono`) for future use — apply with `font-geist` / `font-mono`.
- **Motion:** `npm install motion` — import from **`motion/react`** (same API as Framer Motion). Use **`useReducedMotion()`**; when true, skip or zero-out durations / hover springs.
- **Scroll:** Lenis in `SmoothScroll` wrapper in `layout.tsx`.
- **Optional 3D:** `@splinetool/react-spline` with dynamic `ssr: false`; scene URL `NEXT_PUBLIC_SPLINE_SCENE_URL` (`.splinecode` URL) if a Spline hero background is used.

## Brand palette (`globals.css` → Tailwind)
- **`--brand-field`:** `#070908` — near-black page field (`bg-brand-field`), Williams-style. Deep companion: `--brand-field-deep` `#000000`.
- **`--brand-primary`:** `#0c393e` — brand green for CTAs, accents, soft ambient touches only (not full-section washes).
- **`--brand-surface`:** `#f2f2f2` — light ink / accents on dark (`--foreground`).
- **`--brand-secondary`:** `#1f2f3e` — deeper navy accent (prefer white/opacity on dark sections).
- **`--brand-primary-hover`:** `color-mix` darker primary for buttons.
- **`--background` / `--foreground`:** field + surface (dark theme by default; `color-scheme: dark`).

## Global UX
- **Theme:** Near-black with a **fixed center brand-green glow** (`BrandBackdrop` in layout) that stays while scrolling — like Williams’ blue stage / Coming Soon atmosphere. Sections stay transparent so the glow shows through. Hero adds the 3D dotted scene on top.
- **Scrollbars hidden** on `html` and `body` (`scrollbar-width: none`, `::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none }`) — scrolling still works.

## Layout / UI conventions
- **Navbar:** Transparent background; white links/CTAs on dark; mega + mobile panels use `bg-brand-field` + white type. Logo + nav links; **Contact** on the right; mobile hamburger + animated panel (`AnimatePresence`).
- **Hero:** Full-viewport (`min-h-[100dvh]`) with AmbientBackground + dotted scene; white type; content `justify-end`.
- **Footer:** `bg-brand-field` + AmbientBackground (no scene); white / `white/80` text.
- **Animations:** Prefer slower, eased motion (`ease` ~ `[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]`); staggered hero; navbar load + mobile menu; footer `whileInView` + column stagger. Soften springs for buttons/links (lower stiffness).

## Code style (user preferences)
- Focused diffs; match existing patterns; prefer citations and clear prose in replies.
- Run commands in the real environment; use authoritative project paths when possible.
